        <activityName xml:lang="en">Fluorine, liquid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fluorine, liquid, at plant
This module investigates the production of fluorine as a basic product for SF6. It is a rough and incomplete inventory which is based on information found in the literature.  ;
CAS number: 007782-41-4; 
Formula: F2; 
UUID: d4611a78-a764-3cfa-8920-1eeaf4cbea0d
Production of fluorine from hydrogene fluoride. Infrastructure estimated with generic data. Data for raw material KF were not available.
Location: Estimation for Europe
Technology: Electrolysis of KF-2HF (40.68 wt % HF)
Time period: Time of publication
Production volume: 17000 t/a worldwide
Sampling: Literature survey 
Extrapolations: From single data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d4611a78-a764-3cfa-8920-1eeaf4cbea0d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
